{"availability":"available","full":"cz1993/MirrorArc","name":"MirrorArc","description":"Local-first, governed documentation for humans and AI agents—mirror Office, PDF, and GitHub sources into linked Markdown knowledge workspaces.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":99,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-17T21:04:12Z","updated":"2026-10-04T16:43:17Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cz1993.github.io/MirrorArc/","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-agents","ai-documentation","developer-tools","document-management","document-processing","documentation","github","governance","knowledge-base","knowledge-graph","knowledge-management","local-first","markdown","obsidian","office-documents","open-source","pdf","provenance","python"],"demo":"https://cz1993.github.io/MirrorArc/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:11:59.017Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:11:59.017Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:11:59.017Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:09.392Z","stars":99,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:10.869Z","stars":99,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:11:59.017Z","stars":99,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Preserve sources. Minimize derived documents. Generate knowledge views when they are needed.","MirrorArc is an open-source, local-first Python toolkit that turns changing Office files, PDFs, GitHub repositories, datasets, and Markdown into a governed knowledge-projection system. It keeps original records authoritative, creates deterministic Markdown projections for opaque sources, maintains source-backed relationships, and renders human or agent context without adding a vector database or an AI-generated wiki.","Generative AI made documentation fast and cheap to create. It did not make a growing collection of summaries, entity pages, hubs, and agent notes cheap to verify or maintain. MirrorArc treats every durable derivative as a liability that must justify its existence; the information and knowledge carried by the sources remain the asset."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cz1993/MirrorArc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ae70c17f33f8d574c399303ec02b6b2a91e216c86eb3ba737e953484616df9c8","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:15:51.868Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:15:51.868Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T16:43:17Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:48:04.368Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Preserve sources. Minimize derived documents. Generate knowledge views when they are needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cz1993/MirrorArc/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ae70c17f33f8d574c399303ec02b6b2a91e216c86eb3ba737e953484616df9c8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cz1993/MirrorArc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:15:51.868Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cz1993/MirrorArc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:15:51.869Z","hash":"ae70c17f33f8d574c399303ec02b6b2a91e216c86eb3ba737e953484616df9c8","originalBytes":21339,"storedBytes":21339,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["mirrorarc","root","my-data-product","docs","evidence","profile","context","review","catalog","local","markdown","source","code","html","plan","sources","document","init","sync","current","data-product","frozen","json","public","status","views","bash","demo","examples","lifecycle","only","ontario","ontario-electricity-evidence-vault","relationships","repository","vault","without","agent","before","benchmark","example","include-content","install","knowledge","migration","optional","page","pageindex","pipx","product","run","state","when","doctor","execution","github","human","implementation","intelligence","license","meta","mirror","path","pdf","pinned","portal","private","prompt","provenance","python","recovery","remain","scaffold","task","authority","bounded","conversion","create","documentation","does","files",